  "description": "Eugene receives a wedding invitation from her long-time crush. While drinking to relieve his disappointment, he happens to see an ad for a 'rental boyfriend' - and he becomes entranced by a man with a style similar to his crush and signs up to be his rental boyfriend...\n\n *\"You signed up, rental boyfriend?\"*\n\nBut what's this? A man with a completely different, fierce appearance than the one in the ad shows up!\n\n *\"It was originally only available to women... but I'll make it special just this once, rental boyfriend.\"* There's no way... he can't tell him that someone completely different showed up! What should he do...?\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes eight extra chapters.*",
